  <heading>TFLTNZ</heading>
  <desc>
    <brief>
      <para>Test bit and fault if nonzero</para>
    </brief>
    <authored>
      <para>This instruction compares the value of a bit in a
general-purpose register with zero, and conditionally generates a
Conditional fault exception if the comparison is not equal.
This instruction does not affect condition flags.</para>
    </authored>
  </desc>
